  "body": "ctx 2.2.5 restores the skill’s original guidance to search prior agent work before starting unfamiliar work, resuming a task, or revisiting an investigation. It also explains when to query an indexed code graph.\n\n- Existing managed skills refresh automatically after upgrading. Locally edited skills are preserved.\n- Fix imports after OpenCode’s SQLite migration, including repeat imports and retained session evidence.\n- Restore Blame attribution for supported primary agent sessions.\n- Requested imports that fail now return a failing exit status instead of reporting success.\n\nRun `ctx upgrade` to update.\n\n[Full changes](https://github.com/ctxrs/ctx/compare/v2.2.4...v2.2.5).\n\nReleased: 2026-10-01. [Source](https://github.com/ctxrs/ctx/commit/7a1e4ae41dc702756c68b7188779ee104f0a740d).\n"
}
